<tr><td colspan=2><font face='Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica' size=2>Hah, the 2 mirv thing was the best update ever.  Not only did it reduce the spamming, but it in turn sped up the connection because the spammers weren't able to just lob those mirvs and make the latency sky-rocket.  Yes, the pyro can be played well.  As a pyro if I can get within about 5 feet of an HW he is gone... just circle strafe him with the flamethrower cause he turns so slow that he would never hit me unless I run across his barrel, or he get smart and holds a mirv which would take us both out.  I don't play pyro too much though, soldier and medic are better in my opinion.  They are only going to take out hand held conc jumping?  I wish one of these people would have said that unstead of saying something about removing the conc grenade.  While they are at it they should take out the water concing thing so that then only the trully skilled could do it.</font></td></tr>
</table>
</center><br>
